  "intro": "Technical parameters for Casing (CSG) and Tubing Anchor Catchers (TAC) Model B-2 and B-3 specifications.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "list",
      "heading": "Key Operational Considerations",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "Shear Pin Release (Sizes 43-47): Factory assembled with ten 5,000 lb shear pins (50,000 lbs total), expandable up to twelve pins (60,000 lbs max).",
        "Shear Pin Release (Size 51): Assembled with 12 shear pins, expandable up to 16 shear pins (PN: 01-52939-00).",
        "Deep Run Rule (8,000 ft+): 7\" Casing TACs (Sizes 47A, 47B, 47 x 3.00, 47B x 3.00) require two drag springs per slot when set at or below 8,000 ft.",
        "Exemption: 5\" (Size 43) and 9-5/8\" (Size 51) TACs do not require double drag springs regardless of depth."
      ]
    }
  ],
